WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:04.000
Meet Ava. One general-purpose agent for many kinds of work.

2
00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:11.373
Research, write, analyze data, automate routines, and build software.

3
00:00:11.657 --> 00:00:13.436
Start with a folder and a goal.

4
00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:18.024
Bring notes, files, and images into one workspace.

5
00:00:18.434 --> 00:00:21.569
Turn source material into a deliverable you can review.

6
00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:26.969
Hand a browser tab to Ava to inspect pages and fill forms.

7
00:00:27.379 --> 00:00:29.388
Take control whenever you need to.

8
00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:35.499
Skills bring your instructions into repeatable workflows.

9
00:00:35.909 --> 00:00:39.749
MCP connects tools from local programs and remote services.

10
00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:44.801
Schedule recurring prompts, then come back to the results.

11
00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:48.397
Background work needs an awake machine and a running backend.

12
00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:54.878
Connect machines over SSH, and pick up work across durable sessions.

13
00:00:55.181 --> 00:00:58.417
Review results on the board and explore usage analytics.

14
00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:04.054
Choose your model. Work in the desktop, web interface, or command line.

15
00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:05.729
Or embed Ava in Python.

16
00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:08.979
Open source. Built to work beyond code.

17
00:01:09.389 --> 00:01:10.855
What will you make with Ava?
